        "original_id": "ecc5aec0-cb81-5a3a-a7b8-0ff63c994644",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Five Nights at Freddy's, Five Nights at Freddy's 2, Destiny, Sunset Overdrive, Titanfall, The Evil Within, Watch Dogs\n- Places: Freddy Fazbear's Pizza\n- Concepts: new intellectual properties, haunted animatronics, security cameras, chronological order in the series\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, the video game industry released many new intellectual properties, including Destiny, Five Nights at Freddy's, Sunset Overdrive, Titanfall, The Evil Within, and Watch Dogs.\n- Five Nights at Freddy's centers on Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, a fictional pizza restaurant.\n- In Five Nights at Freddy's, the player acts as a night security guard who defends against malfunctioning, haunted animatronic characters by tracking them through the facility with security cameras.\n- Five Nights at Freddy's 2 is the second game in the Five Nights at Freddy's series.\n- Five Nights at Freddy's 2 is chronologically set before the events of the first Five Nights at Freddy's game.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
